[Quotes]

victory0 = "Do not avert your eyes. Gaze upon my true being."
victory1 = "The match is decided. Let the victor pass."
victory2 = "Do you hear it: the screaming of irrelevant thoughts coming from the sea bottom?"
victory3 = "Join the parade of the dead and march your way to Naraku!"
victory4 = "Such ostentation? True power lies within."
victory5 = "Those who live in darkness are not ruled by it. Those drawn to the shadow do not live by it."
;Perfect
victory6 = "Do you hear it? The mosaic of soul in the void."
;Low-Life
victory7 = "You fight well... But until I meet him, I..."
;Ash
victory8 = "You cannot melt it away with flame. You cannot singe my soul..."
victory9 = "Ash... What exactly do you have in mind?"
victory10 = "Ash, what are you after? What do you hope to accomplish by yourself?"
;Ash/Shen
victory11 = "I salute your ability... Can't believe you did that well."
;Shen
victory12 = "I wonder, is it because I'm fighting you that I'm having so much fun, Shen?"
;Kyo
victory13 = "Know when to retreat. Your flames burn hot but they do not compare to those of Hell."
;Kyo/Iori
victory14 = "Back off! Do you honestly wish me to extinguish your life's flame too...?"
;Iori
victory15 = "Your soul does not even belong in the depths of Hell. There is no solace for you anymore..."
;Andy
victory16 = "The road to the other world is long and harsh. Proceed with caution." 
;Benimaru
victory17 = "It seems he is not here... Farewell."
victory18 = "Leave everything hereafter to me... I thank you for the assistance."
victory19 = "Nikaido... Have you lost your touch?"
victory20 = "We both have such different lives. I, for one, do not enjoy fighting." 
;Chin
victory21 = "Teaching you about the Hizoku would only shorten your life, old man."
;Dark Ash
victory22 = "Falling into eternal darkness... This is an appropriate end for you."
;Duo Lon
victory23 = "I'm not the same as I was yesterday. I will not be defeated by an illusion!" 
;Gato
victory24 = "Look into my eyes and know: are you too destiny's victim?"
;Hwa Jai
victory25 = "Maybe I'm not one to talk, but your way of life disgusts me."
;K'
victory26 = "I like you, I too take fate by the neck." 
victory27 = "Can your flames burn shadows? If not, then they can't burn me too."
;Kensuo
victory28 = "Let me ask you one thing: have you ever met a man named Ron?"
;Kim
victory29 = "I am place beyond good or evil, a place upon your judgement."
;King
victory30 = "The souls of the dead haunt the depths of my heart. Can you see them?"
;Shion
victory31 = "Know not the enemy. Know thyself. Bah! Know me or perish!"
;Leona
victory32 = "You're still young, yet you talk of life and death. I guess I should pity you." 
;Mature
victory33 = "Do you hear the cries of the lost souls? You shall be joining them soon!" 
;Mai
victory34 = "Your fire is joke compared to Luan's. You pose no threat to me."
;NEST Kyo
victory35 = "Don't worry, I won't kill you, but I'll make sure I never see you again."
;Robert
victory36 = "Kyoguken Style Karate? I'll remember that."
;Saiki
victory37 = "Tormented souls travel the world on raging winds.You'll join them soon."
;Terry
victory38 = "Live on the edge of shadow and do not be consumed by it. That's the Hizoku way."
;Yuri
victory39 = "Cherish the bond you share with your share with your brother. It will be too late once you lose him."